LS.add({"80fa231441":{"t":"04 與父同質 He is true God from true God, of one being with the Father","b":3,"k":"unit","h":"<nav class=\"cr\" style=\"--c:#b03a2e\"><a href=\"index.html\">燈臺 <i lang=\"en\">The Lampstand</i></a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl0\" href=\"#ic38303dbb5\">3 聖經真理 Bible Truths</a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl1\" href=\"#i4640b6fad5\">Lessons 課程</a></nav><h1 class=\"fl2\" id=\"第四課--與父同質-he-is-true-god-from-true-god-of-one-being-with-the-father\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第四課 · 與父同質</span> He is true God from true God, of one being with the Father</h1><details class=\"toc\"><summary>目錄 <i lang=\"en\">Contents</i></summary><ol><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\">摘要 Summary</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#1-%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86-the-truth\">1. 真理 The truth</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#2-%E8%B2%AB%E7%A9%BF%E5%85%A8%E6%9C%AC%E8%81%96%E7%B6%93-through-the-whole-bible\">2. 貫穿全本聖經 Through the whole Bible</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2a-%E6%87%89%E8%A8%B1-the-promises\">2a. 應許 The promises</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2b-%E7%B4%84-the-covenant\">2b. 約 The covenant</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2c-%E9%A0%90%E8%A1%A8-the-types\">2c. 預表 The types</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2d-%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B-the-stories\">2d. 故事 The stories</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2e-%E5%9C%A8%E5%9F%BA%E7%9D%A3%E8%A3%8F%E6%88%90%E5%85%A8-fulfilled-in-christ\">2e. 在基督裏成全 Fulfilled in Christ</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#3-%E5%8E%9F%E6%96%87-the-words-beneath-it\">3. 原文 The words beneath it</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#4-%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0-what-all-confess\">4. 共同的信仰 What all confess</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#5-%E7%82%BA%E4%BD%95%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81-why-it-matters\">5. 為何重要 Why it matters</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#5a-%E5%B8%B8%E8%81%BD%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%96%91%E5%95%8F-questions-people-ask\">5a. 常聽到的疑問 Questions people ask</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#6-%E5%AF%A6%E8%B8%90-in-practice\">6. 實踐 In practice</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#7-%E9%80%A3%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7-connected\">7. 連在一起 Connected</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#8-%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E8%88%87%E8%AC%9B%E9%81%93-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\">8. 應用與講道 For us, and for the preacher</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#9-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92-five-review-questions\">9. 複習 Five review questions</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#10-%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E5%87%BA%E8%99%95-links-and-sources\">10. 連結與出處 Links and sources</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#%E5%BE%85%E6%9F%A5-to-check\">資料說明 Source notes</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#tag-words-%E6%A8%99%E7%B1%A4%E8%A9%9E\">Tag words 標籤詞</a></li></ol></details>\n<p><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖經真理</span></span> · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經與信條</span></span> · <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">上一課：</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i9a03ac51dc\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 3 課 一次獻上</span></a> · <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">下一課：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 5 課 道成肉身</span></span></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"摘要-summary\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">摘要</span> Summary</h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一句話：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌基督是真神，出於真神。祂是永遠的道，太初與神同在，道就是神；祂與父同一本體，是受生的，不是受造的，萬物都是藉着祂造的。所以我們敬拜祂，如同敬拜父。</span><br><em>In one line: Jesus Christ is true God from true God. He is the eternal Word, who was with God in the beginning and was God; of one being with the Father, begotten, not made, the one through whom all things were made. So we worship him as we worship the Father.</em></p>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一頁看全課</span></th><th>At a glance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#1-%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86-the-truth\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">真理</span></strong> The truth</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">真神、出於真神、同質、非受造（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1John.5.20\">約壹 5:20</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1-3\">約 1:1-3</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.30\">10:30</span>）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#2-%E8%B2%AB%E7%A9%BF%E5%85%A8%E6%9C%AC%E8%81%96%E7%B6%93-through-the-whole-bible\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">全本聖經</span></strong> The Bible</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約說耶和華的話，新約用在耶穌身上：「我是」（出</span> 3:14 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.8.58\">約 8:58</span>）、萬膝跪拜（賽</span> 45:23 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.10\">腓 2:10</span>）、首先的末後的（賽</span> 44:6 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.17\">啟 1:17</span>）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#3-%E5%8E%9F%E6%96%87-the-words-beneath-it\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文</span></strong> The words</a></td><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">λόγος</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μονογενής</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἕν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μορφή</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">χαρακτήρ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">θεότης</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶהְיֶה</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֵל גִּבֹּור</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶחָד</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#4-%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0-what-all-confess\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經</span></strong> The creeds</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">尼西亞（325, 381）：「出自真神的真神，受生而非被造，與父本性相同」；東西方與更正教同認。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#5-%E7%82%BA%E4%BD%95%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81-why-it-matters\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為何重要</span></strong> Why</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">只有神能救人，只有神能把神表明出來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.43.11\">賽 43:11</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">約 1:18</span>）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#6-%E5%AF%A6%E8%B8%90-in-practice\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">實踐</span></strong> In practice</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">敬拜、向祂禱告、看祂認識父、信靠、謙卑、傳講。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#7-%E9%80%A3%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7-connected\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連在一起</span></strong> Connected</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文研究、希伯來書第 1 章、講章、教會歷史（尼西亞）、聖詩。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#8-%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E8%88%87%E8%AC%9B%E9%81%93-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道</span></strong> To preach it</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">約 1:1</span>, 14：太初有道、道就是神、道成了肉身。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#9-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92-five-review-questions\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">複習</span></strong> Review</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">五題，附答案與經文。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">太初有道，道與神同在，道就是神。（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">約翰福音 1:1</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">John 1:1</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"1-真理-the-truth\">1. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">真理</span> The truth <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌基督是真神，出於真神。祂是永遠的道，太初就與神同在，道就是神；祂與父同一本體，是受生的，不是受造的；萬物都是藉着祂造的。看見祂，就是看見父。</span></strong><br><em>Jesus Christ is true God from true God. He is the eternal Word, with God in the beginning, and the Word was God; of one being with the Father, begotten, not made; through him all things were made. Whoever has seen him has seen the Father.</em></p>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">因為神本性一切的豐盛都有形有體的居住在基督裏面，（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.2.9\">歌羅西書 2:9</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">for in him dwelleth all the fulness of the Godhead bodily, (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.2.9\">Colossians 2:9</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">四個詞概括新約的教導：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">真神</span> true God<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「就是在他兒子耶穌基督裏面。這是真神，也是永生」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1John.5.20\">1 John 5:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">出於真神</span> from true God<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「只有在父懷裏的獨生子將他表明出來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">John 1:18</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；子出於父，像光輝出於光（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">來 1:3</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">同質</span> of one being<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我與父原為一」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.30\">John 10:30</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。不是兩位神：神只有一位（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Deut.6.4\">申 6:4</span>；第 7、8 課）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">非受造</span> not made<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「萬物是藉着他造的；凡被造的，沒有一樣不是藉着他造的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.3\">John 1:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：祂自己不在受造之物裏面。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"2-貫穿全本聖經-through-the-whole-bible\">2. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">貫穿全本聖經</span> Through the whole Bible <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><img class=\"emb\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"charts/L04 the LORD and Jesus 耶和華與耶穌.svg\" src=\"pages/42532a9700.svg\"><br><em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一張圖看全本聖經：左邊是舊約說耶和華的經文，右邊是新約把同樣的話用在耶穌身上；綠線是直接引用，藍線是呼應。</span></em></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新約的作者都是猶太人，天天背誦「以色列啊，你要聽！耶和華我們神是獨一的主」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Deut.6.4\">Deut 6:4</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。他們沒有放棄這一句，卻把耶穌放在這一句裏面（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.8.6\">林前 8:6</span>，第 3 段）。</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"2a-應許-the-promises\">2a. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應許</span> The promises</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">全能的神：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「因有一嬰孩為我們而生；有一子賜給我們」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.9.6\">Isa 9:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），祂的名稱為「奇妙、策士、全能的神、永在的父、和平的君」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.9.6\">Isa 9:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。「全能的神」</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֵל גִּבֹּור</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，以賽亞在下一章用同一個稱號說耶和華：「必歸回全能的神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.10.21\">Isa 10:21</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">從亙古就有：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">伯利恆</span> Bethlehem<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">בֵּית־לֶחֶם</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Βηθλεέμ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）要出一位掌權的，「他的根源從亙古，從太初就有」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mic.5.2\">Mic 5:2</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。生在小城的，根源卻在時間以先。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">我的主：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「耶和華對我主說：你坐在我的右邊」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.110.1\">Ps 110:1</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。耶穌問：「大衛既稱他為主，他怎麼又是大衛的子孫呢」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.22.45\">Matt 22:45</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。新約一再引用這一句（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.34-35\">徒 2:34-35</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.13\">來 1:13</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神啊，你的寶座：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「神阿，你的寶座是永永遠遠的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.45.6\">Ps 45:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；希伯來書引來說子：「論到子卻說：神啊，你的寶座是永永遠遠的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.8\">Heb 1:8</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。（和合本在詩篇作「神阿」，在希伯來書作「神啊」。）</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2b-約-the-covenant\">2b. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">約</span> The covenant</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一位神，一位主：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">示瑪說耶和華是</span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶחָד</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，七十士譯本作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">κύριος εις εστί</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。保羅照着示瑪寫：「然而我們只有一位神，就是父，萬物都本於他」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.8.6\">1 Cor 8:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），「並有一位主，就是耶穌基督，萬物都是藉着他有的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.8.6\">1 Cor 8:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。示瑪的「神」說父，「主」說耶穌：仍是一位神，沒有分成兩個。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">求告耶和華的名：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「凡求告耶和華名的就必得救」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Joel.2.32\">Joel 2:32</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）</span>→ <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「凡求告主名的，就必得救」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.10.13\">Rom 10:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），上一句說的「主」是耶穌（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.10.9\">羅 10:9</span>）。七十士譯本把</span> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">יְהוָה</span></a> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">譯作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">κυρίου</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；使徒把它讀成耶穌。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶和華我們的義：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">大衛的苗裔「他的名必稱為『耶和華我們的義』」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Jer.23.6\">Jer 23:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；保羅說基督「成為我們的智慧、公義、聖潔、救贖」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.1.30\">1 Cor 1:30</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2c-預表-the-types\">2c. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">預表</span> The types</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">燃燒的荊棘：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神對摩西</span> Moses<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">מֹשֶׁה</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Μωϋσῆς</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）說「我是自有永有的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Exod.3.14\">Exod 3:14</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。耶穌說「還沒有亞伯拉罕就有了我」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.8.58\">John 8:58</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），「於是他們拿石頭要打他」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.8.59\">John 8:59</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：他們聽懂了（第 3 段）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">以賽亞看見的主：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我見主坐在高高的寶座上」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.6.1\">Isa 6:1</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；約翰說「以賽亞因為看見他的榮耀，就指着他說這話」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.12.41\">John 12:41</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），上下文的「他」是耶穌（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.12.37\">約 12:37</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">智慧：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">箴言第 8 章的智慧說「那時，我在他那裏為工師」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Prov.8.30\">Prov 8:30</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；新約說基督「基督總為神的能力，神的智慧」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.1.24\">1 Cor 1:24</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），萬物都藉着祂造（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.16\">西 1:16</span>）。這是一幅圖畫，不是說基督受造（第</span> 5a <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">段）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2d-故事-the-stories\">2d. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">故事</span> The stories</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">赦罪：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「小子，你的罪赦了」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.2.5\">Mark 2:5</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；文士心裏說「除了神以外，誰能赦罪呢」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.2.7\">Mark 2:7</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。他們的神學沒有錯，只是不認得眼前這一位。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">受敬拜：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">風住了以後，「在船上的人都拜他，說：「你真是神的兒子了。」」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.14.33\">Matt 14:33</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。彼得和天使都拒絕人拜他們（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.10.25-26\">徒 10:25-26</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.8-9\">啟 22:8-9</span>），耶穌卻接受。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">多馬</span> Thomas</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Θωμᾶς</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：「我的主！我的神！」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.28\">John 20:28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。一個猶太人對一個人說「我的神」，耶穌沒有糾正他，反說「那沒有看見就信的有福了」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.29\">John 20:29</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">大祭司的審問：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你是那當稱頌者的兒子基督不是」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.14.61\">Mark 14:61</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；「我是。你們必看見人子坐在那權能者的右邊，駕着天上的雲降臨」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.14.62\">Mark 14:62</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.110.1\">詩 110:1</span> 加上但 7:13（第 2 課），大祭司就撕開衣服（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.14.63\">可 14:63</span>）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2e-在基督裏成全-fulfilled-in-christ\">2e. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在基督裏成全</span> Fulfilled in Christ</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">太初有道：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「太初有道，道與神同在，道就是神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">John 1:1</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；「道成了肉身，住在我們中間」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.14\">John 1:14</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">萬膝要跪拜：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶和華說「萬膝必向我跪拜；萬口必憑我起誓」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.45.23\">Isa 45:23</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），又說「我必不將我的榮耀歸給假神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.42.8\">Isa 42:8</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。保羅卻把這句話用在耶穌身上：「因耶穌的名無不屈膝」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.10\">Phil 2:10</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），「無不口稱「耶穌基督為主」，使榮耀歸與父神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.11\">Phil 2:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">首先的，末後的：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我是首先的，我是末後的；除我以外再沒有真神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.44.6\">Isa 44:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）</span>→ <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活的主說「我是首先的，我是末後的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.17\">Rev 1:17</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；22:13）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">萬物藉祂造，靠祂立：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「一概都是藉着他造的，又是為他造的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.16\">Col 1:16</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；「他在萬有之先；萬有也靠他而立」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.17\">Col 1:17</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。希伯來書把說耶和華的詩 102:25 用在子身上：「主啊，你起初立了地的根基」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.10\">Heb 1:10</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一同受敬拜：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「但願頌讚、尊貴、榮耀、權勢都歸給坐寶座的和羔羊，直到永永遠遠」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.5.13\">Rev 5:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：第 3 課的羔羊，和父同受敬拜。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"3-原文-the-words-beneath-it\">3. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文</span> The words beneath it <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">字</span> Word</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">意思</span> Meaning</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新約</span> NT (OpenGNT) / <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約</span> OT (BHSA)</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">本課的經文</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">λόγος</span></span> <em>lógos</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">道、話</span> word</td><td>330 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次（317 節）</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">約</span> 1:1, 14</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μονογενής</span></span> <em>monogenḗs</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">獨一的、獨生的</span> only, unique</td><td>9 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.14\">約 1:14</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">18</span>；</span>3:16</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μορφή</span></span> <em>morphḗ</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">形像、本相</span> form</td><td>3 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">腓</span> 2:6, 7</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">θεότης</span></span> <em>theótēs</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神性、神的本體</span> deity</td><td>1 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">西</span> 2:9</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">χαρακτήρ</span></span> <em>charaktḗr</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">印記、真像</span> exact imprint</td><td>1 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">來</span> 1:3</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">הָיָה</span></span> <em>hâyâh</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是、存在</span> be<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Exod.3.14\">出 3:14</span> 的</span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶהְיֶה</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是「我是」</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約 3,575 次</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">出</span> 3:14</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֵל</span></a> <em>ʼêl</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神</span> God</td><td>248 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.9.6\">賽 9:6</span>；</span>10:21</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶחָד</span></span> <em>ʼechâd</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一、獨一</span> one</td><td>968 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">申</span> 6:4</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">λόγος</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，道：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">約 1:1</span> 有三句。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Ἐν ἀρχῇ ἦν ὁ Λόγος</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：太初已經「有」，</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἦν</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是一直存在的「是」，不是 1:3 萬物</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγένετο</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「被造、成了」的那個字。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ὁ Λόγος ἦν πρὸς τὸν Θεόν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：與神同在，面對面，有位格的分別。</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span lang=\"grc\">Θεὸς ἦν ὁ Λόγος</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：道就是神；</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span lang=\"grc\">Θεὸς</span></a> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">沒有冠詞、放在句首，說的是道的本性（冠詞見</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希臘文文法 第 1 頁</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。一行中立的話：所以不能譯作「道是一位神」（耶和華見證人的《新世界譯本》），也不能說道就是父（撒伯流</span> Sabellius<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。到了 1:14，</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ὁ Λόγος σὰρξ ἐγένετο</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，又</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐσκήνωσεν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「支搭帳幕」住在我們中間，像會幕裏的榮耀（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Exod.40.34\">出 40:34</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μονογενής</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，獨生：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">約 1:18</span> 的抄本有兩種讀法。</span>OpenGNT<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（照</span> NA28<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μονογενὴς Θεὸς</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「獨一的神」；</span>KJV \"the only begotten Son\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">John 1:18</span>, KJV)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span>ASV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">和和合本「獨生子」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">John 1:18</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）跟着另一種讀法。兩種讀法都說子在父懷裏，把父「表明」出來：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐκεῖνος ἐξηγήσατο</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，英文</span> exegesis<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「釋經」就從這個字來。這個字本身的意思是「獨一無二」；信經的「受生」是教會讀這一組經文所得的結論（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.14\">約 1:14</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.3.16\">3:16</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1John.4.9\">約壹 4:9</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἕν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，原為一：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγὼ καὶ ὁ Πατὴρ ἕν ἐσμεν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.30\">約 10:30</span>）：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἕν</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是中性的「一」（一體），不是陽性的</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">εἷς</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（一個人）；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐσμεν</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是複數「我們是」：兩位，一體。猶太人聽懂了：「又為你是個人，反將自己當作神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.33\">John 10:33</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；早先他們也說他</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἴσον ἑαυτὸν ποιῶν τῷ Θεῷ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「將自己和神當作平等」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.5.18\">John 5:18</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μορφή</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，神的形像：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐν μορφῇ Θεοῦ ὑπάρχων</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.6\">腓 2:6</span>），然後</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μορφὴν δούλου</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（2:7）：兩個「形像」一樣真實。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">τὸ εἶναι ἴσα Θεῷ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span>KJV \"thought it not robbery to be equal with God\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.6\">Phil 2:6</span>, KJV)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span>ASV \"counted not the being on an equality with God a thing to be grasped\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.6\">Phil 2:6</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：與神同等是他本來就有的，他不緊抓不放，反倒虛己。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">θεότης</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀπαύγασμα</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">χαρακτήρ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">πᾶν τὸ πλήρωμα τῆς Θεότητος σωματικῶς</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.2.9\">西 2:9</span>）：神本體的全部，</span>KJV<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span>ASV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">都作</span> \"the fulness of the Godhead bodily\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.2.9\">Col 2:9</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">來 1:3</span>：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀπαύγασμα τῆς δόξης</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，光發出的光輝，有光就有光輝，兩者同時、同質：信經「出自光明的光明」的根；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">χαρακτὴρ τῆς ὑποστάσεως αὐτοῦ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，印模壓出來的印記，</span>KJV \"the express image of his person\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">Heb 1:3</span>, KJV)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span>ASV \"the very image of his substance\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">Heb 1:3</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ὑπόστασις</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在這裏是「本體」；後來教會用這個字說三個「位格」，</span>KJV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">的</span> <em>person</em> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">帶着後來的用法。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶהְיֶה</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">與</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγὼ εἰμί</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶהְיֶה אֲשֶׁר אֶהְיֶה</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Exod.3.14\">出 3:14</span>），七十士譯本作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">εγώ ειμι ο ων</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「我是那存在的」。耶穌說</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">πρὶν Ἀβραὰμ γενέσθαι ἐγὼ εἰμί</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：亞伯拉罕是「成了」（</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">γενέσθαι</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），他卻是「我是」。啟示錄稱神為</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ὁ ὢν καὶ ὁ ἦν καὶ ὁ ἐρχόμενος</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.8\">啟 1:8</span>），「是昔在、今在、以後永在的全能者」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.8\">Rev 1:8</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），正是七十士譯本的</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ο ων</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֵל גִּבֹּור</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，全能的神（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.9.6\">賽 9:6</span>）：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希伯來文</span> BHSA <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">編作 9:5。七十士譯本先譯作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μεγάλης βουλής άγγελος</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「大謀略的使者」；本地的七十士譯本（</span>ABP<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）後面還有</span> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span lang=\"grc\">θεός ισχυρός</span></a> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">等一串稱號，</span>Swete <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">的正文沒有這些稱號（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.9.6\">Isa 9:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קָנָנִי</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Prov.8.22\">箴 8:22</span>：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קָנָה</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">多半是「得着、擁有」（</span>KJV<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span>ASV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">作</span> <em>possessed</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），和合本作「就有了我」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Prov.8.22\">Prov 8:22</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；七十士譯本作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">κύριος έκτισέ με</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「主創造了我」。亞流</span> Arius <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">用這一句說子是受造的（第</span> 5a <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">段）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶחָד</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，獨一：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">示瑪的</span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶחָד</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">說耶和華是獨一的，沒有別神（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.45.22\">賽 45:22</span>）。這個字本身不證明三位一體；新約在這「獨一」裏面看見父、子、聖靈（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.28.19\">太 28:19</span>，單數的</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">εἰς τὸ ὄνομα</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「名」；第 8 課）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"4-共同的信仰-what-all-confess\">4. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">共同的信仰</span> What all confess <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">尼西亞信經（325, 381）：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「出自光明的光明，出自真神的真神，受生而非被造，與父本性相同，萬物藉他而有。」（合一中譯本）</span>\"God from God, Light from Light, true God from true God, begotten, not made, of one Being with the Father; through him all things were made.\" (ELLC 1988)</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為甚麼寫這幾行：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">亞流</span> Arius<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（亞歷山大的長老）教導子是第一個、最高的受造者，</span>\"there was when he was not\"<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。325 年尼西亞會議用</span> <em>homoousios</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「同質」回答：子與父同一本體；亞他那修</span> Athanasius <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一生為此辯護；381 年君士坦丁堡會議確認，並寫下論聖靈的幾行。2025 年是尼西亞會議 1700 週年。見</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">教會歷史 · 國教化時期</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">迦克墩（451）</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">說基督「按神性與父同質，按人性與我們同質」（大意，第 3 行）；</span><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">亞他那修信經</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">說父如何，子也如何：非受造、永恆、全能，卻不是三位神，乃是一位神（大意，7–18 行）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">各傳統同認：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">東正教、天主教、更正教都認信這幾行，許多教會在崇拜中同誦這份信經。今天在大公信仰以外，有團體（如耶和華見證人、一位論派）認為子不是永遠的神；各傳統的教會都以尼西亞信經回答。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經</span> Creeds<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span class=\"off\">AC 3</span> · <span class=\"off\">NC 5–12</span> · <span class=\"off\">CH 3</span> · <span class=\"off\">AT 7–18</span> · <span class=\"off\">WCF II, VIII</span> · <span class=\"off\">WLC 6–11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；全文與各行連結：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經與信條</span> Creeds and confessions</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"5-為何重要-why-it-matters\">5. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為何重要</span> Why it matters <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為信仰。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">只有神能救人：「惟有我是耶和華；除我以外沒有救主」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.43.11\">Isa 43:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。如果耶穌不是真神，十字架只是一個好人的死（第 3 課）；「牧養神的教會，就是他用自己血所買來的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.20.28\">Acts 20:28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）就說不通。只有神能把神表明出來：「人看見了我，就是看見了父」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.9\">John 14:9</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為基督徒的生活。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">我們敬拜耶穌、向耶穌禱告，不是拜偶像：「求主耶穌接收我的靈魂」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.7.59\">Acts 7:59</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。那位「常用他權能的命令托住萬有」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">Heb 1:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）的，也托住你。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為人的存在。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神不是遙遠、不可知的力量；祂在一個人的臉上讓人看見（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Cor.4.6\">林後 4:6</span>）。</span><em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">從統計的角度看：從樣本推論母體，總有誤差；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">約 1:18</span> 說子把父「表明」出來，<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">來 1:3</span> 說他是神本體的「真像」。他不是一個樣本，是本體的印記。</span></em></p>\n<h3 id=\"5a-常聽到的疑問-questions-people-ask\">5a. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">常聽到的疑問</span> Questions people ask</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「因為父是比我大的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.28\">John 14:28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">說的是他取了奴僕形像的地位和職分（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.7\">腓 2:7</span>），不是本性；同一卷書說「我與父原為一」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.30\">John 10:30</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。亞他那修信經說：按神性與父同等，按人性小於父（大意）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「首生的」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.15\">西 1:15</span>）。</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">πρωτότοκος</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是名分：神說大衛「我也要立他為長子，為世上最高的君王」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.89.27\">Ps 89:27</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），大衛並不是第一個生的。下一節說萬有都是藉着他造的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.16\">西 1:16</span>）：他不在被造之物裏面。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「子也不知道」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.13.32\">Mark 13:32</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在他取了的人性裏，他甘心受限制（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.7\">腓 2:7</span>）；見第 6 課 真神真人。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Prov.8.22\">箴 8:22</span>「主創造了我」。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">這是七十士譯本的譯法；希伯來文多半是「擁有」。這一章是智慧的擬人化，詩意的圖畫；新約說萬物是藉着基督造的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.3\">約 1:3</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.16\">西 1:16</span>），他就不能是其中之一。亞他那修把這一節讀成道成肉身以後的事（</span><em>Orations against the Arians</em> II.44-56<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「聖經裏沒有『三位一體』這個詞。」</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">對；這個詞是教會為了總結聖經的教導而用的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.28.19\">太 28:19</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Cor.13.14\">林後 13:14</span>）。重要的不是詞，是它總結的經文。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"6-實踐-in-practice\">6. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">實踐</span> In practice <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">敬拜祂：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">像多馬（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.28\">約 20:28</span>），像天上地上一切被造的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.5.13\">啟 5:13</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">向祂禱告：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">像司提反（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.7.59\">徒 7:59</span>），像最早的教會說「主必要來」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.16.22\">林前 16:22</span>，第 2 課）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">看祂，認識父：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">讀福音書，就是看父的心（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.9\">約 14:9</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信靠：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">托住萬有的，也托住你的明天（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">來 1:3</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">謙卑：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你們當以基督耶穌的心為心」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.5\">Phil 2:5</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：有神的形像，卻虛己。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">傳講：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">清楚說耶穌是誰：「但記這些事要叫你們信耶穌是基督，是神的兒子」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.31\">John 20:31</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"7-連在一起-connected\">7. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連在一起</span> Connected <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文研究：</span></strong><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\">S17 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span lang=\"grc\">θεός</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֵל</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֱלֹהִים</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，同一個字說父，也說子（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">約 1:1</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.28\">20:28</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.8\">來 1:8</span>）。</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i1b5f27bacc\">S18 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">彌賽亞</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：詩 2 篇、110 篇。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：1.26「我是自有永有的」。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">基督論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：2.04 神的兒子、2.23 首生。</span><span class=\"off\"></span><span class=\"off\"></span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">書卷研究：</span></strong><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i7a592efe93\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希伯來書</span></a> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 1 章：七處舊約經文，子超過天使（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.5-13\">來 1:5-13</span>）。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">羅馬書</span></span> 9:5<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：一行中立的話在那裏（標點不同，讀法不同）。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">啟示錄</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：阿拉法、俄梅戛，首先的、末後的。</span></li>\n\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">教會歷史：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">國教化時期</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：君士坦丁、尼西亞、亞流與亞他那修。一句：信經不是在書房裏寫的，是在逼迫、放逐和爭論中守住的。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖詩：</span></strong><span class=\"off\">Holy, Holy, Holy <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖哉聖哉聖哉</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span>SVCA 2<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，三一的神）</span>· <span class=\"off\">O Come, All Ye Faithful <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">哦來蒙恩群眾</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span>SVCA 50<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；第二節唱的就是尼西亞的話）</span>· <span class=\"off\">Fairest Lord Jesus <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">美哉主耶穌</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span>SVCA 343<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）· 韓德爾《彌賽亞》第一部〈因有一嬰孩為我們而生〉（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.9.6\">賽 9:6</span></span><span class=\"off\"></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">看得見的地方：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖經圓圖：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">約翰福音</span></span> · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希伯來書</span></span> · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">歌羅西書</span></span> · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">以賽亞書</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"8-應用與講道-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\">8. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應用與講道</span> For us, and for the preacher <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌不只是好老師、先知或榜樣；</span>C. S. Lewis <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">說：他若不是主，就是騙子或瘋子（</span><em>Mere Christianity</em>, 1952<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。他給我們的選擇，沒有第四條路。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">我們不必在「愛耶穌」和「敬拜獨一的神」之間二選一：敬拜子，正是榮耀父（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.11\">腓 2:11</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.5.23\">約 5:23</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">思考：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">你禱告的時候，稱呼耶穌比較像稱呼一位朋友、一位老師，還是像多馬說的「我的主，我的神」？</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道：<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">約 1:1</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.14\">14</span>，三點</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「太初有道」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">John 1:1</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：永遠的那一位。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在創世記第一個字以前已經「有」（</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἦν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；約翰福音用創 1:1 的話開頭。</span></li>\n<li><strong>B <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「道與神同在，道就是神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">John 1:1</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：真神，又與父有分別。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">面對面（</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">πρὸς τὸν Θεόν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），同一本體（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.30\">約 10:30</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong>C <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「道成了肉身，住在我們中間」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.14\">John 1:14</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：神來到我們中間。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我們也見過他的榮光，正是父獨生子的榮光」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.14\">John 1:14</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；看見他，就看見了父（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.9\">約 14:9</span>）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"9-複習-five-review-questions\">9. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">複習</span> Five review questions <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">尼西亞信經說子是「出自真神的真神，受生而非被造，與父本性相同」：用你自己的話說明這三句。</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">子本身是真神，從父而出，像光出於光（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">來 1:3</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">約 1:18</span>）；「受生」說他和父同一本體，「被造」才是不同的本體（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.3\">約 1:3</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.16\">西 1:16</span>）；同質：與父同一本體（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.30\">約 10:30</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.2.9\">西 2:9</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約說耶和華的哪三段話，新約用在耶穌身上？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我是」（出</span> 3:14 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.8.58\">約 8:58</span>）；「萬膝必向我跪拜」（賽</span> 45:23 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.10-11\">腓 2:10-11</span>）；「我是首先的，我是末後的」（賽</span> 44:6 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.17\">啟 1:17</span>）。也可以舉：珥</span> 2:32 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.10.13\">羅 10:13</span>；詩</span> 102:25 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.10\">來 1:10</span>；賽</span> 6:1 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.12.41\">約 12:41</span>。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.1\">約 1:1</span> 的三句，</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἕν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.30\">約 10:30</span>）和</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">χαρακτήρ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">來 1:3</span>）各告訴我們甚麼？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">道永遠存在（</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἦν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）、與神有分別（</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">πρὸς τὸν Θεόν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）、本性是神（</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span lang=\"grc\">Θεὸς ἦν ὁ Λόγος</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἕν</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是中性：一體，不是一人；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">χαρακτήρ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：神本體的印記，看見他就看見父（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.9\">約 14:9</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「父是比我大的」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.28\">約 14:28</span>）和「首生的」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.15\">西 1:15</span>）怎樣理解？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">前者說他取了奴僕形像的地位（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.7\">腓 2:7</span>），不是本性（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.10.30\">約 10:30</span>）；後者是名分（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.89.27\">詩 89:27</span>），他是萬物的創造者，不是其中之一（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.16\">西 1:16</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌是真神，對救恩、敬拜和生活有甚麼分別？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">只有神能救人（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.43.11\">賽 43:11</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.20.28\">徒 20:28</span>）；我們敬拜他、向他禱告（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.28\">約 20:28</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.7.59\">徒 7:59</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.5.13\">啟 5:13</span>）；看他認識父（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.9\">約 14:9</span>）；信靠托住萬有的那一位（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.1.3\">來 1:3</span>）；學他虛己（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.5-7\">腓 2:5-7</span>）。</span></p></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"10-連結與出處-links-and-sources\">10. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連結與出處</span> Links and sources <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">範疇：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">基督論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（2.04 神的兒子、2.23 首生）；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（1.02 耶和華、1.26 我是自有永有的）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">前後課：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">上一課</span> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i9a03ac51dc\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 3 課 一次獻上</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：十字架上的是神的兒子（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.20.28\">徒 20:28</span>）。下一課</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 5 課 道成肉身</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：真神成為真人。又見</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 6 課 真神真人</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 7 課 獨一的神</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 8 課 三位一體</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 15 課 耶穌是主</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 23 課 永遠的聖子</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 52 課 萬物藉祂而造</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 53 課 同受敬拜</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 96 課 基督超乎天使</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">資料：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">和合本、</span>ASV 1901<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span>KJV 1769<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span>OpenGNT<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span>BHSA<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；七十士譯本</span> = ABP <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">的希臘文本（</span>Sixtine 1587<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，經</span> Bos 1709<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">書目：</span></strong>Athanasius, <em>On the Incarnation</em> and <em>Orations against the Arians</em>; Murray J. Harris, <em>Jesus as God</em> (1992); Richard Bauckham, <em>Jesus and the God of Israel</em> (2008); Larry Hurtado, <em>Lord Jesus Christ</em> (2003); Bruce Metzger, <em>A Textual Commentary on the Greek New Testament</em> (2nd ed., 1994), on <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.1.18\">John 1:18</span>.</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經：</span></strong>ELLC, <em>Praying Together</em> (1988)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；《尼西亞信經》合一中譯本；迦克墩、亞他那修信經（大意）。</span> English translations of the Nicene Creed © 1988 English Language Liturgical Consultation (ELLC), and used by permission. www.englishtexts.org</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"待查-to-check\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">資料說明 Source notes</span> <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.9.6\">Isa 9:6</span> (BHSA 9:5) in the Septuagint: the LXX used here (ABP, the Sixtine text) adds a list of titles after the \"angel of great counsel\"; Swete's text does not.</li>\n<li>Athanasius on <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Prov.8.22\">Prov 8:22</span>: <em>Orations against the Arians</em> II, chapters 19-20, sections 44-56 (NPNF; section 51: \"signifies, not the Essence, but the manhood of the Word\").</li>\n<li>O Come, All Ye Faithful, verse 2 (\"God of God, Light of Light\"): the representative text on Hymnary.org, based on Oakeley (1841).</li>\n<li>C. S. Lewis, <em>Mere Christianity</em> (1952), Book II ch. 3: quoted here in paraphrase only.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"tag-words-標籤詞\">Tag words <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">標籤詞</span> <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p>#t/deity-of-christ <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">基督的神性</span> deity of Christ <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span lang=\"grc\">θεός</span></a> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֵל</span></a> · #t/word <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">道</span> the Word <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">λόγος</span></span> · #t/son-of-god <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神的兒子</span> Son of God <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">υἱός</span></span> · #t/i-am <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">我是</span> I AM <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶהְיֶה</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγὼ εἰμί</span></span> · #t/lord <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">主</span> Lord <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i3adf5d2ccf\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">יְהוָה</span></a> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">κύριος</span></span> · #t/only-begotten <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">獨生</span> only begotten <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μονογενής</span></span> · #t/one-god <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">獨一的神</span> one God <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אֶחָד</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">εἷς</span></span> · #t/creation <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">創造</span> creation · #t/firstborn <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">首生</span> firstborn <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">πρωτότοκος</span></span> · #t/glory <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">榮耀</span> glory <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i45a4481517\"><span lang=\"grc\">δόξα</span></a> · #t/worship <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">敬拜</span> worship · #t/trinity <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">三位一體</span> Trinity · #t/nicaea <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">尼西亞</span> Nicaea · #t/creeds <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經</span> · #t/preaching <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道</span><br><em></em></p><details class=\"pn across\" open><summary>跨燈 <i lang=\"en\">Across the lamps</i></summary><p class=\"acr\" data-b=\"3\"></p></details>"}});
